- ```
+ ```

- The schedules which are provided, in the package `retryTenacities`, cover the usual choices:
+ Los calendarios que se proporcionan, en el paquete `retryTenacities`, cubren las elecciones
+ habituales:

= The schedules which are provided, in the package `retryTenacities`, cover the usual choices:
=
- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

= The schedules which are provided, in the package `retryTenacities`, cover the usual choices:
=
= ```tabular
- column  Given
+ column  Given

- column  Delay before a retry
- column  Attempts
- row  `exponentialForeverTenacity`  10ms, growing by a factor of 1.2 each time  unlimited
- row  `exponentialFiveTimesTenacity`  10ms, growing by a factor of 1.2 each time  5
- row  `exponentialTenTimesTenacity`  10ms, growing by a factor of 1.2 each time  10
- row  `fixedNoDelayForeverTenacity`  none  unlimited
- row  `fixedNoDelayFiveTimesTenacity`  none  5
- row  `fixedNoDelayTenTimesTenacity`  none  10
+ column  Espera antes de un reintento
+ column  Intentos
+ row  `exponentialForeverTenacity`  10ms, que crece por un factor de 1,2 cada vez  ilimitados
+ row  `exponentialFiveTimesTenacity`  10ms, que crece por un factor de 1,2 cada vez  5
+ row  `exponentialTenTimesTenacity`  10ms, que crece por un factor de 1,2 cada vez  10
+ row  `fixedNoDelayForeverTenacity`  ninguna  ilimitados
+ row  `fixedNoDelayFiveTimesTenacity`  ninguna  5
+ row  `fixedNoDelayTenTimesTenacity`  ninguna  10

